   "title": "Resting Grounds (piano cover) - Hollow Knight (soundtrack composed by Christopher Larkin)",
   "track": "Resting Grounds (piano cover) - Hollow Knight (soundtrack composed by Christopher Larkin)",
   "description": "This beautiful piece is called 'Resting Grounds' ; it's a soundtrack from the videogame Hollow Knight and was composed by Christopher Larkin.  As soon as I heard it in the game, I completely fell in love with it and wanted to learn to play this on the piano.\n\nYou can also find the recording on YouTube at https://youtu.be/buLFsEdwUcE\n\nThe piano is a 70's August Förster (Petrof / Czechoslovakia), for the ones that are wondering about that ( sound was recorded with a Zoom iQ5 stereo condenser microphone for iPhone ).\n\nThank you for listening ✨\n\npiano by Leonheart\n© composed by Christopher Larkin",
   "duration": 173.212,
